                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f99edf36-ca4f-4632-841d-4d7808ea0762",
                                                "sense_id": "d622c04d-af16-3278-a5e7-1148adb4a73c",
                                                "text": "We were advised of the risk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2faab346-0908-4b55-acad-97ef0d94fc05",
                                                "sense_id": "d622c04d-af16-3278-a5e7-1148adb4a73c",
                                                "text": "Israel advised us that they believe this action was necessary for its self-defense."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9831f9f7-1f49-3237-b36a-d3932779b75b",
                                        "entry_id": "ddf1ca5f-2216-394b-8b58-13aa113ca24d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To consider, to deliberate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8bf6312-2655-4074-812b-1cc81c8a879d",
                                                "sense_id": "9831f9f7-1f49-3237-b36a-d3932779b75b",
                                                "text": "[…] Samson is reported to the King accordingly. His Majesty, advising of it for a moment, orders that Samson be brought in with the other Twelve."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "232ee799-bd37-3d40-8d9d-fc446231f381",
                                        "entry_id": "ddf1ca5f-2216-394b-8b58-13aa113ca24d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To look at, watch; to see."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b29dca5c-f475-4efb-9322-45851f38e3d9",
                                                "sense_id": "232ee799-bd37-3d40-8d9d-fc446231f381",
                                                "text": "when that villain he auiz'd, which late / Affrighted had the fairest Florimell, / Full of fiers fury, and indignant hate, / To him he turned […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4aeceaa-ac3f-3598-b3d2-9086b70fbbae",
                                        "entry_id": "ddf1ca5f-2216-394b-8b58-13aa113ca24d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To consult (with)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d909f9e-9d4d-4cb6-b1dc-7c90b56dced5",
                                                "sense_id": "a4aeceaa-ac3f-3598-b3d2-9086b70fbbae",
                                                "text": "The armies drawing constantly nearer to each other, the king advised with his council, whether he should march against the Britons, or sall upon the count of Gharolois."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "740e4b85-d838-3ede-a264-7e82e6eb45b1",
                                        "entry_id": "ddf1ca5f-2216-394b-8b58-13aa113ca24d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To deliver judgment after a case has been reserved for further consideration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8ac9c7b-6bce-385f-ba8d-8af8f44e7f2a",
                                        "entry_id": "ddf1ca5f-2216-394b-8b58-13aa113ca24d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To provide information to a sovereign or head of state which they have previously asked for."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee595b95-4572-43fe-8636-34ab064352ec",
                                                "sense_id": "c8ac9c7b-6bce-385f-ba8d-8af8f44e7f2a",
                                                "text": "Empress, I advise you that your audience with the Prime Minister is in 15 minutes, ma'am."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
